  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">2. The target was to market products under the BLU/Mikono brand, at least one jackfruit product in high-end food stores in Europe. The brand and product was developed, tested and approved by panels. However it was not launched in the store because it had shown to be more scalable and cost-effective to sell jackfruit as an ingredient to as many alternative meat brands as possible instead of competing with Mikono in the alt meat market. The brand still exists and is currently being further developed for a brand of jackfruit products for the East African and Middle East market, to be launched in Q2 2023.</narrative>
   </title>
